@BiciTaller.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5186

### Health
GET {{BiciTaller.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Create category
POST {{BiciTaller.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categorias
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "REP",
  "nombre": "Reparacion",
  "descripcion": "Servicios de reparacion general"
}

### List categories
GET {{BiciTaller.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categorias
Accept: application/json

### Create service (replace categoriaId with an existing category GUID)
POST {{BiciTaller.Api_HostAddress}}/api/servicios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "SRV-001",
  "nombre": "Cambio de llanta",
  "precio": 15000,
  "categoriaId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "tecnicoId": null
}

### List clients
GET {{BiciTaller.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Accept: application/json

### List technicians
GET {{BiciTaller.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tecnicos
Accept: application/json
